{
  "_doc": "House Kit styles (housekit/README.md). Read by js/describe.js — every knob here changes a house (tests/describe.test.mjs moves each one to an odd value and checks the pieces change, lessons rule 32). Sizes in metres; one kit cell = `cell` metres wide and one storey tall. Colours are tints multiplied over the painted atlas textures (white = the painting as it is). `looks` names an atlas texture (data/atlas.json) and how it is laid on: 'wrap' repeats both ways at the texture's metres, 'band' lays one beam or plank across the face (painted borders on its edges).",
